UID:conversation-jel-suarez-ana-serrano@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging conversation between artist Jel Suarez
  and OCAD University President + Vice Chancellor Ana Serrano!\n\nIn Conver
 sation: Jel Suarez with Ana Serrano Wednesday\, June 10 – 4 p.m. to 5 p.
 m. Reception: 5 p.m. to 7 p.m. Experience an enlightening conversation bet
 ween the Philippines Ateneo Award recipient artist Jel Suarez and OCAD U P
 resident + Vice Chancellor Ana Serrano as they reveal and introduce Saurez
 ’ practice and inspiration for the work in the exhibition A bouquet of f
 lowers must be held. Together\, they will reflect on family histories\, mi
 gration\, and the ways stories continue to be carried forward. The convers
 ation is followed by an opening reception to celebrate Onsite Gallery’s 
 new exhibitions Jel Suarez | A bouquet of flowers must be held and April H
 ickox | Vantage Point – Unfolding will be held following the In Conversa
 tion program on June 10\, 2026 from 5 p.m. to 7 p.m . Visit Registation Pa
 ge You are invited to gather for an evening of art\, conversation\, commun
 ity\, and celebration.
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/conversation-jel-suarez-an
 a-serrano
